---
 ...-09-04-12-16-31.gh-issue-138497.Y_5YXh.rst |  4 ++
 Tools/jit/README.md                           |  2 +-
 Tools/jit/_llvm.py                            | 49 ++++++++++++-------
 Tools/jit/_targets.py                         | 19 +++++--
 Tools/jit/build.py                            |  3 ++
